commit 58369cf09ec0c9b1a684836f2ef7e0317abec415
Author: Protocodus <protocodus@proton.me>
Date:   Fri Sep 4 15:18:49 2026 +0000

    List only the instruments that have a store page

    Drumalor, Acustra, Taikor, Septum and Ghostar have no Gumroad page, so
    their product pages, cards, screenshots and signal colours come out.
    YouKnow and Electry are what remains.

    The generator now renders a product page only when the product carries a
    store slug, so adding a slug is all it takes to bring a page back rather
    than reconstructing it.

    The copy stops promising more than the page delivers: the products band
    leads on what the instruments are instead of a count, and the store note
    no longer says the rest arrive as nightly builds, because there is no
    rest. Also drops youknow-plugin-card.webp, which the editions band never
    used once the panel shots carried the plug-in edition.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.REDACTED

